WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:02.280
It's summer!

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.220
In preparation for the big event,

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:07.720
everyone's taking a 
breather and kicking back.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:08.960
The young people of Biscotti

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.130
got together for a summer training camp.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.270
I really would've liked to go,

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:15.360
since Sink and Noir were there, too.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.480
Meanwhile, what did we do in Galette

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.990
after welcoming our Hero, Nanami-chan?

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:00.480
Galette is a territory blessed 
by the bounty of the sea.

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:03.060
Galette Sword Style Record!

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:03.060
The town today is peaceful as usual.

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:18.100
Noir is still in Biscotti, but...

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.060
Sorry I'm late.

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:23.130
All right, let's go eat!

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:27.410
Our Hero, Nanami-chan, 
spends so much time with us.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:32.170
Ugh, having all these meetings 
back-to-back is exhausting.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:35.800
Yeah, huh. 
I really wish we could just

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.010
swing our swords and let loose.

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:39.980
Seriously.

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:43.350
Oh, Leo-sama. Gaul-sama.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.590
What's up, Violet?

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:45.470
Is something wrong?

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:47.100
Yes.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:52.850
A strange rumor has spread 
here from the town.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:55.990
Thank you.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:57.260
Welcome.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:02:59.580
A highwayman?

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:00.340
That's right.

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:02.040
That's what they've been saying.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.260
By "highwayman," you mean...

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:07.040
people who rob you of everything, 
even your clothes?

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:11.510
Yes. It's not really happening 
around here, though,

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:14.060
but deeper in the 
continent, around Ayase.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.400
All the guests coming from Ayase

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.990
have been talking about it.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:21.650
It's making a lot of people uneasy.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:23.840
I see.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.880
So the rumor is spreading 
in town, as well...

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:27.240
Yes.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.680
That's all everybody was talking 
about at the Sea Dragon Inn.

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:33.140
I just confirmed it with Ayase's mayor.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:36.590
Because the town has a 
lot of protective power,

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:39.650
there were no fatalities 
or serious injuries.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:42.670
This is still armed robbery!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.230
We can't just let this go.

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:46.640
I don't really like that 
Noir isn't back yet,

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.760
but do you three

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:50.780
want to go check it 
out with me, tonight?

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:51.530
Yes!

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:52.210
I'll go!

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.100
In that case...

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.310
Leo-sama. And you too, Gaul-sama!

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:58.270
You mustn't!

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:00.580
This whole thing will 
blow out of proportion

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:02.360
if either of you two go out there.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:04.740
Plus, Princess Millihiore is scheduled

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:06.850
to dine with us tonight!

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.440
I suppose you're right.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:12.600
But we can't possibly let 
them go on their own.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:19.440
Then I'll lead the operation.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.930
I guess, with that group, 
we have nothing to worry about.

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:29.500
Still, I haven't been to 
the Ayase region in a while.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.800
Going out there wouldn't have been bad.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:32.960
Yeah, huh.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.260
So, Millihi and the others 
should be here soon, right?

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:37.210
Yes.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.500
I believe they are arriving right now.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:50.530
<i>Ayase is a town in the 
eastern part of Galette.</i>

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:53.170
<i>The city was built by people</i>

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:56.030
<i>who were originally from the
 various eastern countries,</i>

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:58.310
<i>and reflects the style 
of their homelands.</i>

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:03.400
I'll go visit the mayor.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.520
Why don't you guys go talk 
to the townspeople?

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:06.820
Sister, wait!

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.870
These are from Leo-sama.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.620
What do you mean?

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.670
This is so Leo-sama!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.880
When in Rome, dress
 as the Romans dress!

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:24.510
Now we totally blend in with the locals!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:25.880
It's perfect!

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.890
Why do I have to wear one, too?

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.680
Well then, let's start our investigation!

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.980
They say that if you walk 
the roads at night,

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:42.270
a suspicious shadow will 
come up behind you.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:45.740
Then it'll say, "What a 
beautiful kimono you have!"

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.030
And when you try to turn...

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.780
It goes, "Bam!"

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:50.740
Really?!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.500
Yeah, they say that he'll take 
your goods and your clothes.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.910
It's horrible.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.670
You can't walk the streets at night.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.290
The highwayman got Yuuta's sister,

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.800
when she was coming home from an errand.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:06.720
The red kimono they had just 
made for her was stolen.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.760
They don't let us play outside much anymore.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.180
I see.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.980
Pops, I left the money here.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.020
Got it! Thanks!

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.110
He's not only a highwayman,

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.900
but a pervert who targets 
kids and girls!

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.610
We've got to stop him.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:32.070
I really want to find him!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:35.620
Hey, I've got a good idea 
for catching the perp.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.450
That's good!

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:45.380
Nanami-chan?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.010
What was your idea?

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.510
Oh, sorry, sorry.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:50.760
I'll tell you after we've 
met up with Violet-san.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.300
That sounds good.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.220
But first, let's have some 
of those sweet dumplings.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.020
Absolutely not!

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:03.980
I can't allow the Hero of our land

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.980
to become the bait for the investigation.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:08.900
I know, but we're kind of famous,

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.030
and our ears and tails 
are pretty flashy...

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.610
Nanami-chan doesn't 
have that problem!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.830
I said, "no."

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.750
Violet-san, please!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:22.080
Everybody is scared, and the 
kids can't play outside...

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.630
I just can't stand that!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.750
I want to catch the perp 
as soon as possible!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.250
I'll be fine.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.970
I have the Ex Machina and 
Vert and Jau will be close by.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.730
You won't give up, will you?

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.730
Fine.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.190
I will respect our Hero's opinion.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:50.940
Yay! Thank you, Violet-san!

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:53.950
You're so kind!
 You're so wonderful!

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:04.580
See you tomorrow!

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.880
Bye-bye!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.870
Thank you for your hard work.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.200
Be careful on the streets at night.

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:40.410
It's not been too safe, lately.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.000
Yes, thank you.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.330
Nanami-chan's disguise is great.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:49.920
Good. Let's scout the area 
while we protect Nanami.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.010
Yeah!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.100
I guess it's almost 
time for shift change.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:08.480
Yeah.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.030
A kid?

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.180
Pardon me,

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.810
young lady.

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.810
You mean me?

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:48.810
That's a nice kimono.

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.810
<i>So it really was him?!</i>

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.980
Wearing something like
 that, at this hour,

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.570
is basically asking to be assaulted.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.950
We found the perp! Vert!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.070
Roger!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.070
Huh?

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:19.710
Oops...

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.720
No, wait a second.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.940
You're the thief who 
keeps terrorizing Ayase!

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:37.860
Too bad you were not able 
to see through my disguise!

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.110
Exactly!

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:42.120
We, the Lion Army's Investigation Unit,

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.990
have clearly seen your face!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.500
Now, let us arrest you!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.750
Sorry, we'll have to continue 
this game another time.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:58.720
Oh no!

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:03.970
We let him get away!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.140
We have to chase him!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:23.240
<i>Just as I thought, 
the real one has come out.</i>

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.280
<i>I wonder if I can handle this by myself.</i>

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.160
Let's split up. 
I'll go this way.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.450
I'll go that way.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.910
Then, I'll go this way!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:44.300
No, it's not here.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.180
Big sister...

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:49.730
That's a nice kimono.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.310
Please give it to me.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:57.570
Jau?!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.930
Don't stop! It's behind you!

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.270
Seriously?!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.240
Heavenly Draw...

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:54.210
Flying Heaven Wolf Fang Attack!

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.170
Do you get it now?

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.470
These are the real perps.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.470
Little monsters who are 
disguised as people.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.220
Monster? These cute things?

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.940
There are probably more out there.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.980
It's dangerous, so you 
should go back to your inn.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.980
Wh-Who are you?

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.320
Got it?

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.360
Take your friends and go home quickly!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.910
Oh yeah, Jau and Vert!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:32.950
Well, I'm sure those two 
won't be defeated or...

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:34.200
They actually were.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.210
We underestimated them.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:52.810
I can sense them more clearly now.

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:54.430
There must be quite a 
few out there, still.

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:01.180
Hey!

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.820
Excuse me!

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:06.650
We're sorry about before.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:07.700
You are...

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:11.660
We're a Hero and bodyguard 
team from Vannette.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:14.120
We came here to investigate.

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:16.370
Oh, you're from the castle...

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:17.830
A Hero?

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.710
We want to assist you!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.710
Our captain of the Imperial Guard
 is also strengthening security

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.670
by directing the guards.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.800
We will help you fight the monsters!

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.100
Okay. If that's the case,
 let's work together.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:36.390
These monsters, the Highwayman 
Rabbits, move in packs.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.020
They have a habit of gathering

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.020
the things their boss likes.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:43.020
This time, it's girls' clothes!

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.320
They have a strong sense of camaraderie.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.070
If one of them gets captured...

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.700
They'll come to rescue them!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:49.780
Here they come!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.570
Four of them!

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.290
Allow me to get you back 
for what you did before!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:14:59.920
Flak Arrows!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.970
Jau, let's go!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.300
I'm ready, Nanami!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:20.810
One, two...

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.560
Tiger King Fist!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.690
Boom.

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:34.030
That's four down.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.700
That sound...

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.720
It's a huge monster!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:52.970
It's headed towards 
the city's main gate.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:55.850
Understood. I will chase it.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.020
I guess he saw no chance 
and decided to run.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.350
Violet-neesama is chasing it right now!

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:09.610
There it is.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:13.990
Someone's there?!

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:15.990
You there! It's dangerous!

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:17.830
Please run!

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:26.000
There's no need to run, is there?

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.500
No, there isn't.

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:55.160
First, you invaded these people's city!

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:59.660
Second, you performed filthy thefts!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:01.410
Third!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:05.420
Bad kids who bother everybody face...

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.420
This Lion King Samurai and...

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.170
Me, the Dog Princess Samurai...

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.180
and will be vanquished!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.180
Here we go, Dog Princess Samurai!

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:25.440
Yes, Lion King Samurai!

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:32.280
Run free, Blade of Judgment!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:34.700
Illuminate the sky, Sword of Banishment!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:42.080
Ex Grandia Finale!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:04.890
Justice is served!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:10.110
Th-They totally stole the show.

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:12.690
Leo-sama, Princess, that's not fair.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:16.490
Oh jeez, those two...

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:20.490
Oh, you guys, it's fine now.

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:21.660
Okay.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.700
Thank you, guys.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.120
I captured all the heroic footage 
of the Lion King Samurai

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:29.210
and the Dog Princess Samurai in here.

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:30.830
Perfect.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.760
I guess they're done over there.

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:36.970
Looks like it.

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.340
Noir!

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:41.720
Well, I'll be on my way, then...

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:42.810
Huh?

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:44.470
No, no, please wait.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:45.720
At least tell us your name.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:48.520
Oh, I'm not really...

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.480
Isuka-sama!

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:52.440
I knew it, it's you!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.190
Yuki-pup!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:58.490
Yes, Isuka-sama. 
It's been a long time!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.200
Yeah.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:03.120
I rushed over here when I sensed

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.120
that some monsters might be loose here,

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:08.160
but I guess you guys are all okay?

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.460
Yeah.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.170
Yuki, who's that?

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.750
Jeez.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.590
I was wondering who caused this ruckus.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.800
Should have known it was you, brother.

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:22.260
Bro...

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.140
...ther?

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:25.930
Hina! Oh, you came, too?

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:28.390
I-I told you not to call me that!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:32.060
Oh, let me introduce you. 
This is Isuka-sama.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.150
Hello.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.980
He's actually milady's older brother.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.150
He's a foolish brother...

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:42.110
A counter-monster swordsman, 
just like Brioche,

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.910
and a world famous swordsmith...

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:49.250
Isuka Makishima-san really 
is an amazing person!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.170
He's already crafted 
many wonderful swords

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:52.710
and blades that are on par

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.500
with the Treasure Swords.

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:58.800
No no, I am just a simple 
wandering swordsmith.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.300
It's fine that you're wandering,

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:03.720
but what were you thinking, 
never sending a note?

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:06.220
I thought you had died 
in some random ditch.

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.810
You're so silly, Hina.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:11.480
Like I would die so easily.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.190
Actually, I hope you're not

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.820
ruining your body 
by drinking too much.

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:19.110
You're one to talk.

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.320
You drink way more than I do.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:24.410
We solved this case, 
so I don't think anyone could

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:29.200
object to some booze at the 
rare reunion of these two.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:32.210
Nanami-san, you guys must be hungry, right?

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.710
Let's have some food, then!

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:36.880
Yay!

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:49.890
Hey, Sink.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.230
The monsters we catch...

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:54.100
you release them in the mountains, right?

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.690
Yes, in a location far 
from the settlements.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:58.610
Well, those are really

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:01.690
more like wild animals,
 rather than monsters.

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:04.200
If coexisting is possible, 
that's the best solution.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.490
I see; that's good.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.120
Apparently, they were able to reclaim

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:10.580
all the stolen clothes 
from the monsters' nests.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:11.450
Yes.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:12.870
All is well, then.

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:16.500
I feel like I wasn't able to do

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.340
anything heroic at all, this time...

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:21.210
Oh well, it was a nice Monster Riot.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.630
And thus...

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:24.170
Case closed.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.100
Yes, yes, yes!

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:37.440
Perfect!

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:41.400
The welcoming plan is perfect, now!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:44.860
Yeah! Let's surprise the 
Princess and Leo-sama!

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:45.950
Of course!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.070
We are ready to welcome both sides!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:52.540
For the pride of Pastillage!

00:23:30.900 --> 00:23:32.370
Together we are...

00:23:32.370 --> 00:23:33.580
The Princess Samurais!

00:23:33.580 --> 00:23:35.140
Don't you think I got 
too little screen time?

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:36.430
Don't worry about it!

00:23:35.240 --> 00:23:40.480
<b>Pastillage's Hero King Legend</b>

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:38.320
You've got fun company, Hina.

00:23:38.320 --> 00:23:40.290
I told you to stop!
